## Proposed Changes

### Database Layer (Prisma ORM)

#### [MODIFY] [schema.prisma](file:///b:/Leads-CRM/backend/prisma/schema.prisma)
- Add `GoogleAdsIntegration` model:
  ```prisma
  model GoogleAdsIntegration {
    id                    String    @id @default(cuid())
    organizationId        String    @unique
    organization          Organization @relation(fields: [organizationId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

    customerId            String?   // 10-digit Google Ads Customer ID (without hyphens)
    developerTokenEncrypted String? @db.Text
    refreshTokenEncrypted String?   @db.Text
    tokenExpiresAt        DateTime?

    // Stage Mapping JSON: e.g. { "qualified": "conv_action_123", "won": "conv_action_999" }
    conversionEventMapping Json?    @default("{}")
    autoSyncConversions   Boolean   @default(true)
    isConnected           Boolean   @default(false)
    lastSyncedAt          DateTime?

    createdAt             DateTime  @default(now())
    updatedAt             DateTime  @updatedAt

    @@index([organizationId])
  }
  ```
- Add `GoogleAdsConversionQueue` model:
  ```prisma
  model GoogleAdsConversionQueue {
    id             String   @id @default(cuid())
    organizationId String
    organization   Organization @relation(fields: [organizationId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
    leadId         String
    lead           Lead     @relation(fields: [leadId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

    eventName      String   // e.g. "QUALIFIED", "WON"
    conversionActionId String?
    gclid          String?
    value          Float    @default(0)
    status         String   @default("pending") // pending, sent, failed
    retryCount     Int      @default(0)
    errorMessage   String?  @db.Text

    createdAt      DateTime @default(now())
    updatedAt      DateTime @updatedAt

    @@index([organizationId])
    @@index([status])
    @@index([createdAt])
  }
  ```
- Add `googleAdsIntegration` and `googleAdsConversionQueues` relations to `Organization` and `Lead` models.

